  <DOCID>begona</DOCID>
  <TIMEX3 tid="t0" type="DATE" value="2017-03-03T00:00:00" functionInDocument="CREATION_TIME" temporalFunction="false">2017-03-03</TIMEX3>
  <TEXT><EVENT eid="e1" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">AURREKARI</EVENT> PERTSONALAK&#13;
-<EVENT eid="e2" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Alergia</EVENT> ezagunik ez.&#13;
-<EVENT eid="e3" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Ohitura</EVENT> toxikorik ez.&#13;
-<EVENT eid="e4" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Iktusa</EVENT> ezkerreko ACM-n <TIMEX3 tid="t1" type="DATE" value="2015-02" temporalFunction="false">2015eko otsailan</TIMEX3>. &#13;
<EVENT eid="e5" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Fibrinolisia</EVENT> eta <EVENT eid="e6" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">trombektomia</EVENT> mekanikoa. &#13;
F XIIIa F genean Val34 aldaeraren <EVENT eid="e7" class="STATE" comment="e3c:permanence=PERMANENT">eramailea</EVENT>.&#13;
-<EVENT eid="e8" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Dermatitis</EVENT> atopikoa.&#13;
-<EVENT eid="e9" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Parotiditisa</EVENT> <TIMEX3 tid="t2" type="DATE" value="2013" temporalFunction="false">2013an</TIMEX3>.&#13;
-<EVENT eid="e10" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Epifisiolisia</EVENT> ezkerreko sorbaldan.&#13;
-Ohiko <EVENT eid="e11" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">tratamendua</EVENT>: <EVENT eid="e12" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Adiro</EVENT> 100 mg (0-1-0).&#13;
&#13;
<TIMEX3 tid="t3" type="DATE" value="PRESENT_REF" temporalFunction="true">ORAINGO</TIMEX3> <EVENT eid="e13" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">GAIXOTASUNA</EVENT>&#13;
<TIMEX3 tid="t4" type="DURATION" value="P4D" temporalFunction="false">Azken 4 egunetan</TIMEX3> 40 ºC-ko <EVENT eid="e14" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">sukarra</EVENT> (<EVENT eid="e15" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">dardarekin</EVENT> lotutakoa) izan duen 16 urteko gizona. &#13;
<EVENT eid="e16" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Mina</EVENT> eta <EVENT eid="e17" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">ezintasun</EVENT> funtzionala aurkezten ditu ere eskuineko orkatilean, ezkerreko sorbaldan eta eskuineko aldakan.&#13;
Ez du beste giltzaduraren <EVENT eid="e18" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">erasorik</EVENT>, ez du azaleko <EVENT eid="e19" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">lesiorik</EVENT> ez <EVENT eid="e20" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">lesio</EVENT> oftalmologikorik. &#13;
Ez du arnas aparatuko, digestibo aparatuko ez <EVENT eid="e21" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">klinika</EVENT> genitourinariorik <EVENT eid="e22" class="REPORTING" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">adierazten</EVENT>.&#13;
Arrisku sexu <EVENT eid="e23" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">harremanak</EVENT> <EVENT eid="e24" class="REPORTING" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">ukatzen</EVENT> ditu. &#13;
Ez du <EVENT eid="e25" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">amigdalitisa</EVENT> ez beste <EVENT eid="e26" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">prozesu</EVENT> infekziosorik aurkeztu <TIMEX3 tid="t5" type="DURATION" value="PXW" temporalFunction="true">azken asteetan</TIMEX3>.&#13;
&#13;
<EVENT eid="e27" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">MIAKETA</EVENT> FISIKOA&#13;
<EVENT eid="e28" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">TA</EVENT> 128/78 <EVENT eid="e29" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">FC</EVENT> 93 <EVENT eid="e30" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Tª</EVENT> 38,2 <EVENT eid="e31" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">ºCSatO2</EVENT> 99%&#13;
<EVENT eid="e32" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Orientazio</EVENT>, <EVENT eid="e33" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">hidratazio</EVENT> eta azal eta mukosen <EVENT eid="e34" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">kolorazio</EVENT> egokiarekin. &#13;
<EVENT eid="e35" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Eupneikoa</EVENT>.&#13;
Ez du <EVENT eid="e36" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">adenopatiarik</EVENT>. &#13;
<EVENT eid="e37" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Lepo-zurruntasunik</EVENT> ez, ez du beste <EVENT eid="e38" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">zeinu</EVENT> meningeorik.&#13;
Toraxa:&#13;
<EVENT eid="e39" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">AC</EVENT>: erritmikoa.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e40" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">AP</EVENT>: mvc.&#13;
Sabelalde biguna, <EVENT eid="e41" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">minik</EVENT> gabekoa. &#13;
Ez dira <EVENT eid="e42" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">masa</EVENT> ez <EVENT eid="e43" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">megaliarik</EVENT> <EVENT eid="e44" class="REPORTING" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">antzematen</EVENT>, ez du peritoneoko <EVENT eid="e45" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">narritadurarik</EVENT>. &#13;
<EVENT eid="e46" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">PPRB</EVENT> negatiboa.&#13;
&#13;
Lokomozio <EVENT eid="e47" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">aparatua</EVENT>: <EVENT eid="e48" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Mina</EVENT> <EVENT eid="e49" class="REPORTING" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">adierazten</EVENT> du ezkerreko giltzadura akromioklabikularrean <EVENT eid="e50" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">mugimenduarekin</EVENT>, <EVENT eid="e51" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">isuririk</EVENT> <EVENT eid="e52" class="REPORTING" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">antzeman</EVENT> gabe. &#13;
Eskuineko aldakan ez du <EVENT eid="e53" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">mina</EVENT> azaltzen <EVENT eid="e54" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">mugimenduarekin</EVENT> ez <EVENT eid="e55" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">haztapenarekin</EVENT>, <EVENT eid="e56" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">mugikortasun</EVENT> egokia mantenduz. &#13;
<EVENT eid="e57" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Hantura</EVENT> diskretua eskuineko tarsoan, <EVENT eid="e58" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">zeinu</EVENT> flogotikorik gabea.&#13;
Azaleko <EVENT eid="e59" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">lesioa</EVENT> esker oineko 5. hatzan, <EVENT eid="e60" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">orbain</EVENT> fasean dagoen azaleko <EVENT eid="e61" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">urraduraren</EVENT> antza duena, <EVENT eid="e62" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">zeinu</EVENT> infekzioso barik <TIMEX3 tid="t6" type="DATE" value="PRESENT_REF" temporalFunction="true">momentu honetan</TIMEX3>.&#13;
&#13;
<EVENT eid="e63" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">MIAKETA</EVENT> OSAGARRIAK&#13;
-<EVENT eid="e64" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Analitika</EVENT>: <EVENT eid="e65" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">BK</EVENT>: <EVENT eid="e66" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">glukosa</EVENT> 123 mg/dL, <EVENT eid="e67" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">GPT</EVENT> 54 U/L, <EVENT eid="e68" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">PCR</EVENT> 10.07 mg/dL, <EVENT eid="e69" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">prokaltzitonina</EVENT> normala. &#13;
<EVENT eid="e70" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Giltzurrun-funtzioa</EVENT>, <EVENT eid="e71" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">albumina</EVENT>, <EVENT eid="e72" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">bilirrubina</EVENT>, <EVENT eid="e73" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">CK</EVENT>, <EVENT eid="e74" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">LDH</EVENT> eta <EVENT eid="e75" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">ioiak</EVENT> normalak.&#13;
-<EVENT eid="e76" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">HRF</EVENT>: <EVENT eid="e77" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Hb</EVENT> 13.7 g/dL, <EVENT eid="e78" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">plaketak</EVENT> 125 000, <EVENT eid="e79" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">leukozitoak</EVENT> 8 200 (79.9% <EVENT eid="e80" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">N</EVENT>), <EVENT eid="e81" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">linfozitoak</EVENT> 0.7 10^3/μL.&#13;
-<EVENT eid="e82" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Koagulazioa</EVENT>: <EVENT eid="e83" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">IP</EVENT> 61 %, <EVENT eid="e84" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">INR</EVENT> 1.39.&#13;
-Epstein-Barr <EVENT eid="e85" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">birusa</EVENT>: negatiboa.&#13;
-<EVENT eid="e86" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Odol-kultiboak</EVENT>: <EVENT eid="e87" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">jasoak</EVENT>.&#13;
-<EVENT eid="e88" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Rx</EVENT> torax:normala.&#13;
-<EVENT eid="e89" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Rx</EVENT> esker sorbalda: normala.&#13;
-<EVENT eid="e90" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Rx</EVENT> eskuin orkatila: normala.&#13;
-<EVENT eid="e91" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">EKG</EVENT>: <EVENT eid="e92" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">sinusala</EVENT> 80 lpm-rekin, errepolarizazioaren <EVENT eid="e93" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">asaldurarik</EVENT> gabe.&#13;
</TEXT>
